TRV optical vendor directory
============================

Drop offline QR **decoder** sources here. No CDN at runtime.

Recommended (Apache-2.0 OR MIT):
  https://github.com/cozmo/jsQR
  Place dist file as:  optical/vendor/jsQR.js

  License: Apache License 2.0 (see upstream LICENSE)
  Copyright (c) Cosmo Wolfe and contributors

Alternate (MIT OR Apache-2.0):
  https://github.com/paulmillr/qr
  May be vendored if preferred; wire import path in qr-receiver if API differs.

Do NOT vendor Meta / Google / Microsoft proprietary SDKs.

Receiver load order:
  1. BarcodeDetector (Chromium) when present
  2. global jsQR from this folder if script tag loads
  3. Paste / file import of TRVL1 lines always works
